# Emergency Fix: UI and DLL Errors

Resolve the missing `libintl-8.dll` (or similar) error and the Tailwind CSS v4 resolution failure in the UI.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The `libint-8.dll` error might be related to a specific native dependency or environment setup. I will attempt to identify the source, but the user might need to install a specific runtime (like MSVC Redistributables or Gettext) if it's not present on the system.

## Proposed Changes

